<?php /** @var array $keys @var array $hooks @var array $deliveries @var array $apiCapabilities @var array $webhookEvents @var string|null $newToken @var string|null $newSecret @var \Core\Security\Csrf $csrf @var string $basePath */ ?>
<?php if ($newToken): ?><div class="card"><h2 style="margin-top:0">New API key</h2><p>Copy this credential now. Only its hash is stored.</p><input readonly value="<?= e_attr($newToken) ?>" onclick="this.select()"></div><?php endif; ?>
<?php if ($newSecret): ?><div class="card"><h2 style="margin-top:0">New webhook signing secret</h2><p>Use it to verify the <code>X-WC-Signature</code> HMAC header.</p><input readonly value="<?= e_attr($newSecret) ?>" onclick="this.select()"></div><?php endif; ?>
<div class="card"><div class="card-heading"><div><h2>API keys</h2><p class="muted">Bearer keys are scoped and stored only as SHA-256 hashes.</p></div></div>
<?php if ($keys): ?><table><tr><th>Label</th><th>Prefix</th><th>Scopes</th><th>Last used</th><th></th></tr><?php foreach ($keys as $key): ?><tr><td><?= e($key['label']) ?></td><td><code><?= e($key['token_prefix']) ?>…</code></td><td><?= e(implode(', ', json_decode((string) $key['capabilities_json'], true) ?: [])) ?></td><td><?= e($key['last_used_at'] ?? 'Never') ?></td><td><?php if (!$key['revoked_at']): ?><form method="post"><?= $csrf->field() ?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="key_revoke"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="<?= (int) $key['id'] ?>"><button class="btn small danger">Revoke</button></form><?php else: ?><span class="badge bad">revoked</span><?php endif; ?></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?></table><?php endif; ?>
<details><summary class="btn secondary">Create API key</summary><form method="post"><?= $csrf->field() ?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="key_create"><label>Label</label><input name="label" required><?php foreach ($apiCapabilities as $cap): ?><label><input style="width:auto" type="checkbox" name="capabilities[]" value="<?= e_attr($cap) ?>"> <?= e($cap) ?></label><?php endforeach; ?><button class="btn">Create key</button></form></details></div>
<div class="card"><h2 style="margin-top:0">Webhooks</h2><p class="muted">Events are queued durably and delivered over HTTPS with an HMAC-SHA256 signature.</p>
<?php if ($hooks): ?><table><tr><th>Label</th><th>URL</th><th>Events</th><th>Status</th><th></th></tr><?php foreach ($hooks as $hook): ?><tr><td><?= e($hook['label']) ?></td><td><code><?= e($hook['url']) ?></code></td><td><?= e(implode(', ', json_decode((string) $hook['events_json'], true) ?: [])) ?></td><td><span class="badge <?= $hook['active'] ? 'ok' : 'bad' ?>"><?= $hook['active'] ? 'active' : 'disabled' ?></span></td><td><?php if ($hook['active']): ?><form method="post"><?= $csrf->field() ?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="webhook_disable"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="<?= (int) $hook['id'] ?>"><button class="btn small danger">Disable</button></form><?php endif; ?></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?></table><?php endif; ?>
<details><summary class="btn secondary">Create webhook</summary><form method="post"><?= $csrf->field() ?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="webhook_create"><div class="inline-fields"><div><label>Label</label><input name="label" required></div><div><label>HTTPS endpoint</label><input type="url" name="url" required placeholder="https://example.com/hooks/core"></div></div><?php foreach ($webhookEvents as $event): ?><label><input style="width:auto" type="checkbox" name="events[]" value="<?= e_attr($event) ?>"> <?= e($event) ?></label><?php endforeach; ?><button class="btn">Create webhook</button></form></details></div>
<div class="card"><h2 style="margin-top:0">Site transfer</h2><p class="muted">Export portable pages and presentation settings. Administrator identities, credentials, submissions and private data are excluded.</p><div class="button-row"><a class="btn" href="<?= e_attr($basePath) ?>/admin/integrations/export">Export JSON</a><form method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data"><?= $csrf->field() ?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="site_import"><input type="file" name="site_file" accept="application/json,.json" required><button class="btn secondary">Import and merge</button></form></div></div>
<?php if ($deliveries): ?><div class="card"><h2 style="margin-top:0">Recent deliveries</h2><table><tr><th>Webhook</th><th>Event</th><th>Status</th><th>HTTP</th><th>Attempted</th></tr><?php foreach ($deliveries as $delivery): ?><tr><td><?= e($delivery['label']) ?></td><td><?= e($delivery['event']) ?></td><td><span class="badge <?= $delivery['status'] === 'delivered' ? 'ok' : ($delivery['status'] === 'failed' ? 'bad' : 'warn') ?>"><?= e($delivery['status']) ?></span></td><td><?= e($delivery['http_status'] ?? '—') ?></td><td><?= e($delivery['attempted_at'] ?? 'Queued') ?></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?></table></div><?php endif; ?>
